<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#dff5ff">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="小饱直播间管理员专用在线歌单。">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/xiaobao-songbook.css">
</head>
<body>
<main id="top" class="songbook-main">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">XIAO BAO · SONGBOOK</p>
      <h1 id="page-title">小饱的歌单</h1>
      <p class="hero-note">挑一首喜欢的歌。点击歌名，点歌弹幕就会自动复制到剪贴板。</p>
      <div class="hero-links" aria-label="主播与管理链接">
        <a href="https://live.bilibili.com/1861300141" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">进入直播间</a>
        <a class="link-quiet" href="/admin">返回管理后台</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="sky-mark" aria-label="歌单共 <%= songTotal %> 首歌">
      <div class="weather-line"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> 天晴，适合唱歌</div>
      <strong><%= songTotal %></strong>
      <p>首歌 · <%= songGroups.length %> 个分类</p>
      <div class="category-summary" aria-hidden="true">
        <% songGroups.forEach(group => { %>
          <span><%= group.category %> <%= group.songs.length %></span>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="song-panel" aria-labelledby="songs-title">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">PICK A SONG</p>
        <h2 id="songs-title">今天想听哪一首？</h2>
      </div>
      <p>点击任意歌曲，即可复制“点歌 + 歌名”</p>
    </header>

    <div class="song-tools">
      <div class="search-wrap">
        <label for="song-search">搜索歌曲</label>
        <div class="search-control">
          <span class="search-symbol" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <input id="song-search" type="search" placeholder="输入歌名，如：晴天" autocomplete="off">
          <button id="clear-search" class="clear-search" type="button" hidden>清除</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="category-tabs" aria-label="歌单分类">
        <button type="button" class="is-active" aria-pressed="true" data-category="全部">全部<span><%= songTotal %></span></button>
        <% songGroups.forEach(group => { %>
          <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-category="<%= group.category %>"><%= group.category %><span><%= group.songs.length %></span></button>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p id="result-count" class="result-count" aria-live="polite">当前显示 <%= songTotal %> 首歌</p>

    <div id="song-groups" class="song-groups">
      <% songGroups.forEach(group => { %>
        <section class="song-group" aria-labelledby="group-<%= group.category %>" data-song-group="<%= group.category %>">
          <div class="group-heading">
            <h3 id="group-<%= group.category %>"><%= group.category %></h3>
            <span><span data-visible-count><%= group.songs.length %></span> 首</span>
          </div>
          <div class="song-grid">
            <% group.songs.forEach((song, index) => { %>
              <button class="song-card" type="button" data-song-name="<%= song %>" aria-label="点歌 <%= song %>，点击复制">
                <span class="song-number"><%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span>
                <span class="song-name"><%= song %></span>
                <span class="copy-hint" aria-hidden="true">点歌</span>
              </button>
            <% }) %>
          </div>
        </section>
      <% }) %>
    </div>

    <div id="empty-state" class="empty-state" role="status" hidden>
      <p>没有找到这首歌</p>
      <span>换个关键词试试，或清除搜索查看完整歌单。</span>
      <button id="show-all-songs" type="button">查看全部歌曲</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>小饱的管理员专用在线歌单 · 点击歌曲即可复制点歌弹幕</p>
    <a href="#top">回到顶部</a>
  </footer>

  <div id="copy-dialog-backdrop" class="copy-dialog-backdrop" hidden>
    <section class="copy-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="copy-dialog-title">
      <div class="copy-dialog-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">COPY MANUALLY</p>
          <h2 id="copy-dialog-title">浏览器拦截了自动复制</h2>
        </div>
        <button id="copy-dialog-close" type="button" class="copy-dialog-close">关闭</button>
      </div>
      <p class="copy-dialog-note">点歌内容已经选中。电脑按 Ctrl+C，手机长按下方文字后选择复制。</p>
      <label for="manual-copy-value">点歌内容</label>
      <input id="manual-copy-value" class="copy-dialog-value" type="text" readonly>
      <button id="copy-dialog-action" type="button" class="copy-dialog-action">再次尝试自动复制</button>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div id="copy-toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden>
    <span class="toast-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span id="copy-toast-message"></span>
  </div>
</main>

  <script src="/xiaobao-songbook.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
